//! Reductions over lists of numbers, chosen by name. Implemented in C (c/src/reduce.c,
//! declared in c/include/rpn/reduce.h) behind this unchanged API: the C reducers are structs
//! of a name and a function, and the façade is the one place with `unsafe` code.
